+=== Check if a field exists
+
+To match events containing any value for a field, compare the field to `null`
+using the `!=` operator:
+
+[source,eql]
+----
+my_field != null
+----
+
+To match events that do not contain a field value, compare the field to `null`
+using the `==` operator:
+
+[source,eql]
+----
+my_field == null
+----
+
